OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FIsrael has shared "serious security
OL,7,Fconcerns" with the White House
OL,8,Fregarding a proposed disarmament deal
OL,9,Fwith Hamas, according to an Israeli
OL,10,Fofficial.
OL,12,FDoron Spielman, spokesperson for Prime
OL,13,FMinister Benjamin Netanyahu's office,
OL,14,Fmade the remarks after Israeli strikes
OL,15,Fovernight into Sunday killed at least
OL,16,F17 people in Gaza, including children.
