OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785764955
OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FIt comes days after US President
OL,7,FDonald Trump hailed an agreement with
OL,8,FHamas, while the militant group
OL,9,Fclaimed it was willing to disarm if
OL,10,FIsrael made certain concessions,
OL,11,Fincluding withdrawing troops from the
OL,12,FPalestinian territory.
OL,14,FHowever, Spielman claimed that
OL,15,FIsrael's intelligence assessment is
OL,16,Fthat Hamas remains committed to
OL,17,Frebuilding its military rather than
OL,18,Fgenuinely demilitarising.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
