CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785764955
OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FHe said that the Israel Defence Forces
OL,7,F(IDF) would not withdraw from Gaza `
OL,8,Fwhere it currently controls more than
OL,9,F60% of the territory ` before Hamas
OL,10,Fdisarms.
OL,12,F"Our assessment is that if we redeploy
OL,13,Fbefore Hamas is truly disarmed, it
OL,14,Fwill quickly expand its presence
OL,15,Fthroughout Gaza, rebuild its terrorist
OL,16,Finfrastructure, once again threaten
OL,17,FIsraeli communities, and seek to carry
OL,18,Fout another October 7-style attack,"
OL,19,Fhe told the Associated Press.
OL,26,@tD@AOUzD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
