OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,F"Disarming means physically giving up
OL,7,Fthe weapons. Nothing less."
OL,9,FHamas said it is willing to lay down
OL,10,Fits arms as part of a US-brokered
OL,11,Fceasefire signed nine months ago,
OL,12,Fadding the ball is now in Israel's
OL,13,Fcourt to "fulfil its obligations
OL,14,Faccording to the agreement".
