OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785764955
OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FIt is unclear exactly what concerns
OL,7,FTel Aviv has conveyed to Washington,
OL,8,Fbut two people with knowledge of the
OL,9,Fdeal said Israel had communicated its
OL,10,Fissues with former British Prime
OL,11,FMinister Tony Blair, who is part of
OL,12,Fthe Trump-led Board of Peace.
OL,14,FSpeaking anonymously, one of them said
OL,15,Fthat Israel wanted freedom to conduct
OL,16,Fmilitary operations in Gaza.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
