CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785764955
OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FAnother source said Israel raised two
OL,7,Fother issues: that Qatar and Turkey
OL,8,Fnot be involved in verifying the
OL,9,Fstages of the agreement, and that
OL,10,FHamas' weapons be destroyed after
OL,11,Fconfiscation.
OL,13,FWhat is in Trump's peace plan?
OL,15,FTrump's 20-point ceasefire plan calls
OL,16,Fon the militant group to surrender its
OL,17,Fweapons and destroy its vast network
OL,18,Fof tunnels.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
