OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FIt also envisions Israeli forces
OL,7,Fwithdrawing from Gaza, the arrival of
OL,8,Fa new technocratic Palestinian
OL,9,Fgovernment, deployment of an
OL,10,Finternational security force and the
OL,11,Frebuilding of the battered Palestinian
OL,12,Fenclave.
OL,14,FHamas disarming has been a sticking
OL,15,Fpoint and has deadlocked negotiations
OL,16,Ffor months. In announcing the deal on
OL,17,Fsocial media on Thursday, Trump said
OL,18,Fit would be carried out in "carefully
OL,19,Fstructured phases".
