OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FA copy of the agreement obtained by
OL,7,Fthe Associated Press, said all weapons
OL,8,Fheld by the Hamas-run police will be
OL,9,Ftransferred to the US-backed
OL,10,FPalestinian technocratic committee,
OL,11,Fknown as the National Committee for
OL,12,Fthe Administration of Gaza, upon its
OL,13,Farrival in the enclave.
OL,15,FIt's not clear when that would happen
OL,16,Fsince it is contingent on other steps.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
