OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FA process to decommission and store
OL,7,Fheavy weapons and to dismantle
OL,8,Fmilitary production sites and tunnels
OL,9,Fwill begin after the arrival of the
OL,10,FPalestinian committee and the
OL,11,Fdeployment of international forces,
OL,12,Faccording to the agreement.
OL,14,FThe process will be linked to a phased
OL,15,FIsraeli withdrawal, according to the
OL,16,Fagreement.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
