OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FUS officials say Israel had been
OL,7,Fconsulted at every step of the
OL,8,Fnegotiations and was not being asked
OL,9,Fto do anything more than what it had
OL,10,Fcommitted to as part of the ceasefire
OL,11,Fand hostage release agreement signed
OL,12,Flast October.
OL,14,FThe areas Israel controls in Gaza have
OL,15,Fbeen mostly destroyed and depopulated.
OL,17,FMost of the territory's two million
OL,18,FPalestinians are in the other part,
OL,19,Fwhere hundreds of thousands live in
OL,20,Fsqualid tent camps and destroyed
OL,21,Fneighbourhoods.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
