OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785764955
OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FIsrael appears unlikely to pull back
OL,7,Fsignificant forces or make other
OL,8,Fconcessions ahead of its October
OL,9,Felections.
OL,11,FPrime Minister Netanyahu faces a tough
OL,12,Fre-election battle, with his far-right
OL,13,Fcoalition partners urging him to keep
OL,14,Fup the pressure on Hamas and leave
OL,15,Fforces in Gaza, and opponents accusing
OL,16,Fhim of failing to prevent the October
OL,17,F7 attack of 2023 that triggered the
OL,18,Fwar.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/14
