OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FHamas-led militants attacked Israeli
OL,7,Fcommunities then, killing around 1,200
OL,8,Fpeople, mostly civilians, and taking
OL,9,F251 others hostage.
OL,11,FIsrael responded with a punishing
OL,12,Fmilitary offensive that has killed
OL,13,Fmore than 73,000 people, according to
OL,14,Fthe Gaza Health Ministry.
OL,16,FThe ministry, which was part of the
OL,17,Frecently dissolved Hamas-run
OL,18,Fgovernment, maintains detailed records
OL,19,Fviewed as generally reliable by UN
OL,20,Fagencies and international
OL,21,Forganisations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
