OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FIt does not distinguish between
OL,12,Fcivilians and militants but says women
OL,13,Fand children make up around half of
OL,14,Fall fatalities.
OL,16,FSince the ceasefire was signed last
OL,17,FOctober, Israel has continued striking
OL,18,FGaza, saying it's targeting Hamas and
OL,19,Fits infrastructure.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
