OL,3,CIsrael says it has serious concerns
OL,4,Cwith Hamas disarmament deal
OL,6,FLocal Gaza hospitals said at least 17
OL,7,Fwere killed in the latest Israeli
OL,8,Fstrikes, including children.
OL,10,FA strike on a residential apartment in
OL,11,Fsouthern Gaza killed three family
OL,12,Fmembers, including their four-year-old
OL,13,Fchild, according to Nasser hospital,
OL,14,Fwhere the bodies arrived.
OL,16,FThe Israeli military said the strikes
OL,17,Fhad targeted militant operatives.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/14
